---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../site-config';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy information for this crochet website.">
<section class="page-heading page-heading-sage"><div class="site-container"><span class="eyebrow">THE IMPORTANT LITTLE DETAILS</span><h1>Privacy <em>policy.</em></h1></div></section>
<section class="site-container legal-content prose"><p><strong>Important:</strong> This page is a template placeholder, <strong>not</strong> a legally complete privacy policy. Replace it before launching, especially if you use analytics, advertising, or cookies.</p><h2>Who we are</h2><p>This website is operated by {siteConfig.name}. Add your real legal or business identity and contact information here.</p><h2>Information and services</h2><p>Explain which analytics, hosting, advertising, forms, and external embeds your deployed website actually uses, and what data each may collect.</p><h2>Advertising and consent</h2><p>If you enable Google AdSense, explain how advertising technology, cookies or other identifiers are used and provide any disclosures and consent controls required for your visitors' locations.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Add the applicable rights and ways users can exercise them, including consent withdrawal where relevant.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Add an email address or other appropriate contact method.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
